<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Prime Minister shall appoint a Chief Executive Officer on such terms and conditions as he may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
