<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive Officer shall be responsible for the general conduct, administration and management of the functions, activities and day-to-day affairs of the Agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_III__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
