<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chairman is absent from any meeting of the Council, he may appoint any member of the Council to replace him as the chairman of the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
