<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council shall appoint the chairman of the committee established under this section."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
