<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The committee may regulate its own procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
