<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The committee may invite any other person to attend any meeting of the committee for the purpose of advising the committee on the matter under discussion, but the person so attending is not entitled to vote at the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
