<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The members of the committee or any person invited under subsection (7) to attend any meeting of the committee may be paid such allowances as the Council may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_II__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
