<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "Every member of the Council or any committee, or any officer, employee, Innovation Ambassador or agent of the Agency, while discharging his duty under this Act as such member, officer, employee, Innovation Ambassador or agent, shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Power to make regulations"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
