<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Innovation Ambassador shall table a report to the Council with regard to his placement at the Ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
