<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The endorsement under this section shall be for a maximum period of two years."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
