<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Agency may, at any time before the expiry of the period specified in subsection (2), revoke the endorsement under this section if the innovative product or service no longer meets the criteria for endorsement as determined by the Agency under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
