<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The owner of the product or service shall have no right of representation in respect of such revocation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
