<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Agency shall establish a national intellectual property central depository."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@> .
